flatcitybuf provides CMake integration via a config-mode package.

  find_package(flatcitybuf CONFIG REQUIRED)

Add the library and the required CXX bridge source to your target:

  add_executable(my_app main.cpp ${FLATCITYBUF_CXX_BRIDGE_SOURCE})
  target_link_libraries(my_app PRIVATE flatcitybuf::flatcitybuf)

Note: FLATCITYBUF_CXX_BRIDGE_SOURCE is a cache variable set by find_package that
points to lib.rs.cc (the CXX bridge generated source). It must be compiled
together with your target — do not link it as a separate library.
